      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7959614c8c75dfea947a313e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "33367a50f8698c89f96ad78efa8751263cdb31a09fe6f673e91b9c9da34e1f35",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5607fc365b36fd51f4b655d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时,速度提升\\n并选择更好的路线＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e56a148cd5b81c1da5de1fcc0b631622af32856a3b859b2984f32227d183d92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2bd7c9752870b10c9dbef2d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时,速度稍微提升\\n并选择稍好的路线＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5931b2fe0fdb23cf3b7794585b6d59c50a772816f26ab7217dc67e75abe3d4b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3defc53d908a23cc25ba918",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘一开始的地方\\n消耗大量体力\\n使速度大幅提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "756e7e42a828fb130242c0896fb1345053e77e237db3fe14f30b4a8500143361",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc00bbdef183e19bc63fb491",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘一开始的地方\\n消耗大量体力\\n使速度少量提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "77522894b1d0db9185ea42e159b5df5ccec004199ace832410d1babeca3a2705",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1768fa957c0d5c6a8915e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘在后方准备超越时\\n提升加速度＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8f75494d04287e7e19ccbcfc0303c1409493116522f5b400130fae605a8616",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0143977303e48bbbe6fcef3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘在后方准备超越时\\n稍微提升加速度\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f02be0509e9907100c89a136d2528ef01ebc0429d02c3821f094d3769660d438",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa200383a622382acb53106",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘,若位于第2名以后\\n且距离前方马娘2马身以内\\n则速度会短暂稍微提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6694ba6105971be63bbc22796be53d4b7b5abdf68001da75cdef93c908399bce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076ff8d9bd9da54924199a2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘,若位于第2名以后\\n且距离前方马娘2马身以内\\n则速度会短暂略微提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d5932c9876b11b47a1ae6470321d461c5acd9d38de4362e9a5d658a432da160",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3b486ff5665fe0e2058438",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若经过最后冲刺却仍处于队伍中部靠后\\n则会稍微消耗持久力提高加速度\\n＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe452a7a071313eac2da82bad31668fa135faa412a878962ae25463bf7a161b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b2ef07883b5a288e818beea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若经过最后冲刺却仍处于队伍中部靠后\\n则会稍微消耗持久力\\n略微提高加速度＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a733f6c708d27d95e368169e19964908d6533a76d60e580bf573de328efa6c40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202422"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7e3ba35f118b8df32f33ac1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时处于领头\\n或距离领头4马身以内\\n则速度和加速度少量提升\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "687918f67cd255c4b69e50bb3ac59ef5df13b3f08d89ff8bb740bb7554aa359c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53b99fe427db7b7f896449a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时处于领头\\n或距离领头4马身以内\\n则速度和加速度略微提升\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "72573f86d6e7c051846268e49a230a528b3e211a74338d9fb2a3180a2bf69521",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202432"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd923e2080df89e2d71c02a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中偶尔会发挥更强的实力\\n速度、力量、根性大幅提升\\n人气较低的情况下更容易触发",
      "source_fingerprint": "613d82190c0d9928ad5e9f047869a38ba32445ac1fb6d01aa466eb9854f8d726",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35dd1dff69d5d549b2c4c7a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中极少情况下发挥更强的实力\\n速度、力量、根性少量提升\\n人气较低的情况下更容易触发",
      "source_fingerprint": "14ba092ced94ebff1d5e73dac771159c37d3c439826fd5540d21f7b48c6da896",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202442"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264fe6c9df070005e057cc44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线位于第二名往后\\n并距离领头4马身以内时\\n速度极大提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a3a087f8ddb3c61500b4f65dd1d1ee14536bfa604b4b74c350b527a2e31fdf0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd8670cebfc2a364b57dc114",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线位于第二名往后\\n并距离领头4马身以内时\\n速度少量提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c0478dbad66d11995ff4b62c7377c14f38ed790f74c58a5d6558e1bcf315e97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202452"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:801527ca4a1d6bd96060177e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线在领头位置且后方1马身内有马娘时\\n速度极大提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b2c817a7605a125e913da685d85b5e3789e8f715b2179cc77c622c179fe96de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fab77e63c088db07c48bf1eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线在领头位置且后方1马身内有马娘时\\n速度少量提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb90fc03aa3545c6edc85cff4ebb3c1c3d5189e84317136510925e3f751640c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe72b3fd1d003827a76c584",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段进行追赶时\\n速度提升＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "274c8f29bc0e08fc53b3271c6fc9b29269ba9790a3ac5ff4770f57780ac34c23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4711fda7c501bd0598ca6295",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段进行追赶时\\n速度稍微提升＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8546e2c8bc1b1f9941fb5eb76760ed78ab0d00aef9eb36a6449627585d555e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
